This product includes software developed at Reyta Labs.

The Rust core links libcrux for ML-KEM-768 and ML-DSA-65, iroh for the QUIC
transport, and the RustCrypto implementations of XChaCha20-Poly1305, X25519 and
Ed25519. Their licenses are recorded in prototype/native/rtp2-core/Cargo.lock
and in the respective upstream distributions.
